# Production: CORS proxy for NanoGPT subscription usage on static hosts
# (GitHub Pages, etc.). NanoGPT does not enable browser CORS on
# GET /api/subscription/v1/usage — balance/models work without this.
#
# Local `npm run dev` uses Vite's /__nanogpt proxy (no env needed).
#
# 1. Deploy workers/nanogpt-usage-proxy (npx wrangler deploy)
# 2. Set the full worker URL (worker.subdomain.workers.dev), then rebuild:
# VITE_NANOGPT_PROXY=https://character-vault-nanogpt-usage.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev
